# Chat Session Report – Character View Biography, Appearance & Notes Fields

### Session Summary
- **Date:** January 2025
- **Version Impact:** 0.10.14 (Patch Increment)
- **Focus:** Added missing biography, appearance, and notes fields to the detailed character sheet view in admin panel, positioned between Status & Resources and Custom Data sections.

### What We Implemented

#### API Updates
- Updated `admin/view_character_api.php` to include `appearance` field in the character data SELECT query, ensuring all three fields (biography, appearance, notes) are fetched from the database.

#### JavaScript Rendering Updates
- Modified `js/admin_panel.js` to display Biography, Appearance, and Notes sections in the detailed character view modal.
